---
export const prerender = true;

import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import PageIntro from "../components/PageIntro.astro";

const updated = "August 25, 2026";
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service" description="The terms that govern your use of ConvertBrio's free file tools and services, including acceptable use, limits, and your responsibilities.">
  <PageIntro eyebrow={`Last updated ${updated}`} title="Terms of Service" />

  <section class="bg-canvas">
    <div class="container-page py-16 sm:py-20">
      <article class="prose prose-neutral max-w-2xl prose-headings:font-semibold prose-headings:tracking-[-0.01em] prose-a:text-brand-600 prose-a:no-underline hover:prose-a:underline">
        <p>
          These Terms of Service (“Terms”) govern your access to and use of ConvertBrio. By using
          our tools, you agree to these Terms.
        </p>

        <h2>1. Using ConvertBrio</h2>
        <p>
          You may use ConvertBrio to convert, compress, and enhance files you own or have the
          right to process. You must be at least 18 years old to use the service.
        </p>

        <h2>2. Acceptable use</h2>
        <p>
          You agree not to upload unlawful, infringing, or malicious content, attempt to disrupt
          the service, or use automated tools to abuse rate limits without our written
          permission.
        </p>

        <h2>3. Your content</h2>
        <p>
          You retain all rights to the files you upload. We claim no ownership over your content
          and only process it to deliver the conversion or enhancement you request.
        </p>

        <h2>4. Paid services</h2>
        <p>
          ConvertBrio does not currently offer paid subscriptions. If paid services are
          introduced, their prices, billing frequency, renewal terms, and cancellation conditions
          will be shown before purchase. These Terms will be updated before paid services become
          available.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Service availability</h2>
        <p>
          We aim to keep ConvertBrio available and reliable but do not guarantee uninterrupted
          access. We may modify or discontinue features with reasonable notice.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Disclaimer & limitation of liability</h2>
        <p>
          ConvertBrio is provided “as is” without warranties of any kind. To the maximum extent
          permitted by law, ConvertBrio is not liable for indirect or consequential damages
          arising from your use of the service.
        </p>

        <h2>7. Changes to these Terms</h2>
        <p>
          We may update these Terms from time to time. Continued use of ConvertBrio after changes
          take effect constitutes acceptance of the revised Terms.
        </p>

        <h2>8. Contact us</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about these Terms can be sent to <a href="mailto:legal@convertbrio.com">legal@convertbrio.com</a> or via our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
